---
import MinistryPage from '../layouts/MinistryPage.astro';
import hero from '../assets/img/uploads/seniors_main_photo.jpg';
import s1 from '../assets/img/uploads/seniors_section_one_photo.jpg';
---
<MinistryPage
  title="Seniors Ministry"
  heroSubtitle="Our seniors hold a special place in our hearts and in our family at Hillcrest. Whether serving as Sunday School teachers, singing in the choir or mentoring the younger generations, our seniors play a vital role in the health of our church."
  heroImage={hero}
  sectionTitle="An Active Community of Senior Adults"
  sectionImage={s1}
>
  <p>
    Hillcrest is blessed with a very active community of senior adults. We offer great opportunities
    for older adults to get to know others who care about them and to grow in their relationship with
    Christ. Our seniors are all about connecting the more experienced members of our congregation to
    each other through fellowship and activities, while working to mentor and influence the younger
    generation.
  </p>
  <p>
    Some of the opportunities we enjoy are weekly worship and Bible study, fellowship luncheons,
    exciting day trips, concerts, shopping outings and much more.
  </p>
  <p>
    Our seniors are heavenly-minded and live abundantly in the goodness of the Lord. They enjoy
    sharing this with others and building friendships that last a lifetime.
  </p>
</MinistryPage>
